            "\n"
            "exit status:\n"
            f"  {EXIT_OK}  all suites passed, no recovery required\n"
            f"  {EXIT_SUITE_FAILED}  at least one suite failed\n"
            f"  {EXIT_USAGE}  invalid command line\n"
            f"  {EXIT_RECOVERED}  all suites passed, but the device required recovery\n"
            f"  {EXIT_DEVICE_UNHEALTHY}  the device could not be made healthy; run abandoned\n"
            "\n"
            "notes:\n"
            "  The device must be otherwise idle: suites open the menu, reset the\n"
